flowchart TD
 S["1 · Select IDNs and source scope<br/>Refresh chosen public newsrooms"]
 C["2 · Collect and extract articles<br/>Allowed URLs · usable title and body"]
 E["3 · Save source evidence<br/>Text, date, URL and capture snapshot"]
 N["4 · NORMALIZATION ENGINE<br/>Classify relevance and standardize facts"]
 V["5 · STRUCTURED-DATA VALIDATOR<br/>Check dates, units, bounds and evidence fields"]
 D["6 · Version and replay check<br/>Same source + content: keep existing version<br/>Changed facts: create pending version"]
 R["7 · Editorial review<br/>Check source · correct facts · approve current version"]
 K["8 · ACTION + RANKING RULES<br/>Suggest follow-up · score five factors · sort"]
 U["9 · Sales dashboard<br/>Selected IDNs → top actions → full account brief"]
 X["Unsupported or invalid items<br/>Excluded or failed in collection log"]
 P["Explicit draft preview<br/>Pending items can be scored for review"]
 F["FUTURE · Personalized recommendation engine<br/>Supplier products, account context and feedback"]
 S --> C --> E --> N --> V --> D --> R
 N -->|Unsupported| X
 V -->|Invalid| X
 R -->|Approved collected versions| K --> U
 R -->|Corrections revalidated| V
 D -.-> P
 P -.-> K
 K -.-> F
 classDef engine fill:#e8efff,stroke:#3563ad,color:#17345e;
 classDef check fill:#fff3df,stroke:#ba8531,color:#6f4711;
 classDef output fill:#e7f3ed,stroke:#4c8a6b,color:#23563d;
 classDef muted fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#475569;
 class N,K engine;
 class V,R check;
 class U output;
 class X,P,F muted;
